  },
  "help": 
"Usage: bb pr merge [options] <id>

Merge a pull request

Options:
  -m, --message <message>  Merge commit message
  --close-source-branch    Delete the source branch after merging
  --strategy <strategy>    Merge strategy (choices: "merge_commit", "squash",
                           "fast_forward", "squash_fast_forward",
                           "rebase_fast_forward", "rebase_merge")
  -h, --help               display help for command

Examples:
  $ bb pr merge 42
  $ bb pr merge 42 --strategy squash --close-source-branch
  $ bb pr merge 42 -m "Merge feature X"

Valid merge strategies:
  merge_commit, squash, fast_forward, squash_fast_forward, rebase_fast_forward, rebase_merge

Defaults:
  --strategy  the repository's configured merge strategy (typically merge_commit)

"
,
}
`;

